**Approach:** Use the **Composite Graph API** (`/composite/graph`), one graph per order. A graph is an all-or-nothing unit (if any subrequest fails, the whole graph rolls back), while other graphs in the same call still commit independently — exactly the "complete or not at all" + "one failing order never blocks the others" requirements. Graph IDs carry the order numbers, and the Opportunity's `AccountId` is resolved from the Account upsert via `@{acct_xxxx.id}`.

```http
